# Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50): the later Horde quests of Camp Mojache and the first of Un'Goro
# Crater, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/feralas_ungoro_crater_49_50.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Feralas, area 357, and
# Un'Goro Crater, area 490). The guide's quest list is section 13 of
# addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the rest of Un'Goro is in Un'Goro Crater (53-54).
# Carried in: Ripple Delivery (81), from Gilveradin Sunchaser in the Hinterlands; Testing the Vessel
# (3123), from Witch Doctor Uzer'i, its wildkin done in the Hinterlands; The Stone Circle (3444), from
# Marvon Rivetseeker in Gadgetzan.
# Left out: the Maraudon quests (Twisted Evils 7028, Vyletongue Corruption 7029, Legends of Maraudon
# 7044, The Scepter of Celebras 7046, Corruption of Earth and Seed 7064, Seed of Life 7066, The
# Pariah's Instructions 7067): their objectives are inside the Maraudon dungeon. Perfect Yeti Hide
# (7738): it starts from a rare hide only skinners find on the yetis.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (Ripple Delivery, Bone-Bladed Weapons, the auction house); Ratchet for the
# Stone Circle; Camp Mojache and the Muisek chain around the camp (hippogryphs, faerie dragons,
# treants); one loop west (the Rage Scar yetis, the giants, the Northspring harpies and Edana, Zorbin
# on the Forgotten Coast) and the hearthstone back; Gadgetzan; south-east Un'Goro (Torwa Pathfinder,
# the ravasaurs, the wrecked raft) and Marshal's Refuge; Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Grom'gol.

guide Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50)
faction horde
levels 49 50
carry 81 580 1122 1444 2874 3123 3444 3568
leave 580 1122 1444 2874 3568 3908 4120
next Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin to Durotar: from the tower outside Undercity, or from Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale" at 50.8,13.4
map Orgrimmar
turnin 81
accept 4300
tip Jes'rimon waits on a balcony above the Drag.
ah 4284.1 npc 8673
ah 4284.2 npc 8673
tip J.D. Collie in Un'Goro Crater wants 7 Power Crystals of each color. Red and yellow are the slow ones to find; green and blue are cheap here too if you see them.
fly "Ratchet, The Barrens" npc 3310

# Ratchet: the Stone Circle -------------------------------------------------------------------------

map The Barrens
do 3444
tip Marvon's Chest sits in his workshop in Ratchet.
fly "Camp Mojache, Feralas" npc 16227

# Camp Mojache -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Feralas
bind 7737
turnin 3123
accept 3124 3128
accept 7734
accept 3062 3063
tip Talo Thornhoof stands inside the big tent.
accept 4120
tip The Strength of Corruption's bears and wolves are in Felwood: a later guide kills them and comes back here.

# The hippogryphs south-west of the camp ------------------------------------------------------------

