tip A few Wandering Forest Walkers roam among the hippogryphs: kill them for Splintered Logs.
do 3124
tip Kill a hippogryph, then use the Hippogryph Muisek Vessel on its corpse.
do 3128.3
do 3128.4 mobs 5305 5304 5300 5306 at 55.1,71.8
turnin 3124
