do 3128.2 bg mobs 5278 at 68.0,47.6
do 3125 mobs 5278 at 68.0,47.6
tip Use the Faerie Dragon Muisek Vessel on each dead Sprite Darter.
turnin 3125
accept 3126
do 3126 at 76.0,40.5
tip The Wandering Forest Walkers walk a long path around Camp Mojache and respawn slowly: wait on their path rather than chase them.
do 3128.1 at 76.0,40.5
turnin 3126
accept 3127

# West: the Rage Scar yetis, the giants, the Northspring harpies -----------------------------------

do 7734
tip The yetis live in and around Rage Scar Hold, a cave north-west of the camp.
do 3128.4 bg mobs 5357 5358 at 39.4,23.2
do 3127
tip Land Walkers and Cliff Giants are level 48-50 elites: pull one at a time and fight it together, then use the Mountain Giant Muisek Vessel on the corpse.
do 3128.2 mobs 5357 5358 at 39.4,23.2
do 3063 bg
do 3062 at 40.5,8.6
tip Every harpy can drop a Horn of Hatetalon. Blow it by the Hatetalon stones at the north end of the ruins to call Edana Hatetalon, a level 50 elite.
do 3063

