# Marshal's Refuge ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fpath 10583
turnin 3845
tip Linken camps by the pool at the north end of the refuge.
accept 3908
tip It's a Secret to Everybody goes to Donova Snowden in Winterspring, in a later guide: keep Linken's sword.
turnin 3884
accept 4284
tip J.D. Collie is inside the cave at the back of Marshal's Refuge.
do 4284 at 57.0,10.5 icon pickup
tip The Power Crystals grow in colored clusters all over the crater; many are on the slopes just east of the refuge. Looting one makes another color spawn nearby.
